  "epistemic_status": "hypothesized",
  "title": "Unconscious, in the only coherent sense, means not existing",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "2d0262ad-dba2-4745-a6b7-875936a30052",
      "text": "If consciousness toggled off in sleep, the alarm clock would create it each morning, which is absurd. So the word names no state of an existing entity. Processing without self-observation is still conscious activity the entity is not watching.",
